sequenceDiagram
  participant Ops as Support Engineer
  participant API as scheduler-api :8005
  participant Proc as langgraph_ingestion_flow.py
  participant Log as langgraph_run_UUID.log
  participant ES as Elasticsearch
  participant DB as Audit DB

  Ops->>API: POST /run-now + x-api-key
  API->>API: Reject if runs.running=true
  API->>Proc: Popen subprocess
  API->>Log: stdout/stderr redirected
  API-->>Ops: run_id, pid, log_path

  loop Pipeline stages
    Proc->>Proc: crawl → audit → LLM → payloads → embed → ES
    Proc->>DB: audit writes
    Proc->>ES: bulk index/delete
  end

  Proc-->>API: exit code
  API->>API: clear active_run, set last_run
